\
\>"]],
 "\n\n",
 StyleBox["Written primarily by Podolsky. Rosen (then 23 years old), who had \
acquired prior experience with \"entangled states\"\[LongDash]yet to be given \
their name\[LongDash]from work on the hydrogen molecule.\n\nPaper pointed out \
that if a composite system (comprised of subsystems A and B), is in an \
entangled state, then the results of measurements performed on A and B will \
exhibit correlations, even though the measurement events lie outside each \
other's lightcones. This held by Einstein, a \"local realist,\" to be absurd\
\[LongDash]spoke of a \"",
  FontSize->18],
 StyleBox["spukhafte Fernwirkung",
  FontSize->18,
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 StyleBox["\" (spooky action at a distance), rendered quantum mechanics \
implicitly nonlocal.\n",
  FontSize->18],
 "\n",
 StyleBox["\"",
  FontSize->18],
 StyleBox["I find the idea quite intolerable that an electron exposed to \
radiation should choose of its own free will, not only its moment to jump \
off, but also its direction. In that case, I would rather be a cobbler, or \
even an employee in a gaming house, than a physicist",
  FontSize->18,
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 StyleBox["\". \[LongDash]AE",
  FontSize->18],
 "\n"
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.4567572893204517`*^9, 3.4567573729934072`*^9}, 
   3.4567574073336143`*^9, {3.4567575479311867`*^9, 3.456757602405839*^9}, {
   3.456757702128508*^9, 3.4567577116884003`*^9}, {3.456758070573998*^9, 
