 FontWeight->"Bold"],

Cell["\<\
Roger Penrose (~1992) heard Peres' describe this work at a conference in \
Copenhagen, asked Peres about the geometrical significance of his set of \
rays. Peres responded that he had not thought about it. Penrose quickly \
realized that they are the symmetry axes of this figure \
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.4578268950245237`*^9, {3.457826937756298*^9, 3.4578269501424217`*^9}},
 FontSize->16],

