Cell["\<\

in which Escher developed an idea suggested to him years before by Penrose's \
father! The story is told on page 30 of the February 1993 issue of Scientific \
American.

Penrose was inspired by Peres' accomplishment (and enabled by his familiarity \
with Ettorre Majorana's little-known spin formalism) to develop his own \
elegant no-go theorem:
\
