Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["\n", "Subsection",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 StyleBox["July 2006", "Subsection",
  FontSize->16,
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 ": John Conway & Simon Kochen (Princeton Mathematics Department) publish \n\n\
\"The Free Will Theorem,\" Foundations of Physics ",
 StyleBox["36",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 ", 1441\[Dash]1473 (October 2006)\n\n",
 StyleBox["\"If the choice of directions in which to perform spin-one \
experiments is \"free\"\[LongDash]not a function of information written into \
the backward lightcone of the experimenter\[LongDash]then the responses of \
the particles are similarly free.\"\n\n",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "Conway & Kochen were motivated by criticism of their initial paper to \
modify their argument: ",
 StyleBox["\"",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "Reply to comments of Bassi, Ghirardi, and Tumulka on the free will theorem: \
The Strong Free Will Theorem,\" Notices of the AMS 56, 226\[Dash]232 \
(February 2009).\n\nConway & Kochen exploit ",
 StyleBox["a remarkable property of paired spin-one particles in",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " \[Ellipsis]\n\n",
 StyleBox["THE SINGLET STATE",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 "\n"
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.456756072679233*^9, 3.456756256208296*^9}, {
   3.456756359582158*^9, 3.456756548295763*^9}, {3.4567565832028646`*^9, 
   3.456756637923698*^9}, {3.456756693198534*^9, 3.45675684309461*^9}, 
   3.457823907653051*^9, 3.468536664336769*^9, {3.4685367268837633`*^9, 
   3.468536728250884*^9}, {3.468537138596696*^9, 3.4685371734670477`*^9}, {
   3.4685372068161917`*^9, 3.4685373154656363`*^9}, {3.468537421575644*^9, 
   3.4685375379053793`*^9}, {3.4685935393044558`*^9, 3.468593582602214*^9}, {
   3.468623948508717*^9, 3.4686239609792833`*^9}},
 FontSize->18],

