 FontSize->16]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Conway & Kuchen take their \"discovery\" very seriously, stress that it is \
after all a \"theorem\". Are reportedly writing a book-length account of the \
subject, to be published by Princeton UP. \n\n\nBut in my view ",
 StyleBox["all they have done is to decorate an old cake with some \
(objectionably anthropomorphic) rhetorical frosting",
  FontColor->RGBColor[1, 0, 0]],
 ". Conway's work has been marked by breathtaking originality, a calculated \
capacity to astound. But here he seems to have fallen victim to his own \
sophomoric enthusiasm. His mathematical innovations have taught us useful \
things we didn't already know. But his Free Will Theorem, though it is based \
upon sound/interesting physics, seems NOT to teach us \"useful things we \
didn't already know,\" and to have no useful consequence.\n\n\nMy guess is \
that the Conway/Kochen Free Will Theorem is destined to be kicked around by \
philosophers/kooks\[Ellipsis]and ignored by physicists\[LongDash]except, \
perhaps, in this regard:\n\n"
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.4686936628759203`*^9, 3.468693755197612*^9}, {
  3.468693902633699*^9, 3.468693984535961*^9}, {3.468694058659343*^9, 
  3.4686941553016*^9}, {3.468694195851112*^9, 3.468694311716151*^9}, {
  3.46869435243362*^9, 3.468694415425696*^9}, {3.4686952530442038`*^9, 
  3.468695253216367*^9}, {3.468696465493677*^9, 3.4686964722336807`*^9}, {
  3.4687130457116423`*^9, 3.468713076923238*^9}, {3.4687131284243517`*^9, 
  3.4687131955813427`*^9}, {3.468713362483087*^9, 3.468713366875555*^9}},
 FontSize->18],

Cell["\<\
Experimentalists who based their work on Bohm/Ahranov used paired \
spin-one-half particles in a specialized state (the singlet state) to \
extablish violation of Bell's inequality\[LongDash]evidence that \
non-contextual hidden variables cannot exist. Kochen-Specker made no \
state-specializing assumption, and very recently (May 2009) experimentalists \
have provided state-independent verification \
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.468695447979225*^9, 3.4686954963326893`*^9}, {
  3.468695547380733*^9, 3.468695599270959*^9}, {3.468695663475522*^9, 
  3.4686956992803593`*^9}, {3.4686959505769444`*^9, 3.468696002862114*^9}, {
  3.46869604862754*^9, 3.4686961037600203`*^9}, {3.468696135950951*^9, 
  3.4686961788530493`*^9}, {3.46869638501919*^9, 3.4686964356014023`*^9}},
 FontSize->18],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"Hyperlink", "[", 
  RowBox[{
  "\"\<State-independent Experimental Non-contextuality\>\"", ",", 
   "\"\<http://arxiv.org/abs/0904.1655\>\""}], "]"}]], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.4686962711990223`*^9, 3.468696318886857*^9}, 
   3.468696357690439*^9},
 FontSize->16],

Cell[BoxData[
 TagBox[
  ButtonBox[
   PaneSelectorBox[{
    False->"\<\"State-independent Experimental Non-contextuality\"\>", True->
    StyleBox["\<\"State-independent Experimental Non-contextuality\"\>", 
     "HyperlinkActive"]}, Dynamic[
     CurrentValue["MouseOver"]],
    BaseStyle->{"Hyperlink"},
    BaselinePosition->Baseline,
    FrameMargins->0,
    ImageSize->Automatic],
   BaseStyle->"Hyperlink",
   ButtonData->{
     URL["http://arxiv.org/abs/0904.1655"], None},
   ButtonNote->"http://arxiv.org/abs/0904.1655"],
  Annotation[#, "http://arxiv.org/abs/0904.1655", "Hyperlink"]& ]], "Output",
 CellChangeTimes->{3.4686965774025183`*^9},
 FontSize->16]
}, Open  ]],

Cell["\<\
of the correctness of the Kochen-Specker conclusion that non-contextual \
hidden variables cannot account for the quantum mechanical facts. Perhaps a \
state-independent experimental dismissal of contextual hidden varables lies \
not too far in the future.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.4686964419413*^9, {3.46869649157664*^9, 3.468696545669591*^9}},
 FontSize->18],

